---
import Image from "astro/components/Image.astro";
import { ChevronRight } from "@lucide/astro";
---

<section class="section section-hero py-10 sm:py-20 my-0!">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 items-center gap-10">
      <div class="text-center sm:text-left">
        <h1>
          Jelajahi <span
            class="bg-linear-to-r from-[#0179B4] to-[#88D8FF] bg-clip-text text-transparent"
            >Pesona</span
          > Malang Raya
        </h1>
        <p class="mt-8 mb-10">
          <span class="text-main-200"
            >Keindahan Alam, Budaya, dan Hiburan Terbaik.</span
          > Temukan pengalaman wisata tak terlupakan di Malang Raya. Dari pemandangan matahari terbit di <span class="text-main-200">Gunung Bromo</span>, keseruan di taman hiburan berkelas, hingga kelezatan kuliner lokal. Rencanakan liburan impian Anda bersama kami.
        </p>
        <a
          href="/destinasi"
          class="btn bg-[linear-gradient(125deg,var(--color-main-100),var(--color-main-200))] text-white border-0 rounded-xl text-lg py-3 px-6 h-auto shadow-xl hover:shadow-2xl"
          >Jelajahi Sekarang <ChevronRight /></a
        >

        <p class="text-sm text-gray-400 mt-10 mb-6">
          Telah dikunjungi oleh jutaan wisatawan:
        </p>
        <div class="flex gap-4 items-center">
            <span class="font-bold text-xl text-gray-600">Wisata Nusantara</span>
            <span class="font-bold text-xl text-gray-600">Jatim Park Group</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <div class="grid relative">
          <Image
            src="/img/hero.jpg"
            alt="Pemandangan Bromo"
            width="600"
            height="400"
            class="w-full h-auto rounded-3xl shadow-2xl [grid-area:1/1/2/2] object-cover"
          />
          <div class="[grid-area:1/1/2/2] mt-auto">
            <div
              class="border-main-200 border-2 rounded-xl p-5 bg-[linear-gradient(-125deg,#E9F6FF_0%,#ffffff_100%)] hidden sm:block sm:max-w-[40%] ml-auto translate-y-10"
            >
              <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3 items-center">
                <p class="text-xl text-black font-bold">
                  2.4M<span class="text-main-200">+</span>
                </p>
              </div>
              <p class="text-main-200 my-2">Wisatawan Puas</p>

              <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3 items-center">
                <span class="text-gray-400 text-sm">⭐ 4.9/5 Rating rata-rata</span>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div
              class="bg-white p-4 rounded-xl shadow hidden sm:flex sm:max-w-[50%] text-main-200 text-lg items-center gap-3 absolute top-10 -left-10"
            >
              <span class="text-2xl">🌋</span>
              Destinasi Terbaik
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
